              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Florida's freight industry moves fast. Whether you're hauling construction equipment across Tampa or delivering goods up the coast, your trailers take on heavy loads, rough roads, and tight delivery schedules. That's why smart fleet owners invest in equipment that goes the distance.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, we proudly offer Globe trailers for sale, built right here in the U.S. and trusted nationwide for their strength, longevity, and unmatched ROI. If you're looking for a trailer that stands up to Florida heat, humidity, and heavy hauls, Globe is a name you can count on.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-go-to-choice",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Globe Trailers Are the Go-To Choice for Florida Fleets",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "go-to-choice"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-go-to-choice-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Globe Trailers has spent more than 40 years designing equipment that keeps America's freight moving. Their trailers are engineered with precision, using high-strength steel and low-maintenance components designed for demanding operations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-go-to-choice-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For fleet owners, Globe means fewer breakdowns, less downtime, and a stronger bottom line. When every mile matters, the difference between a good trailer and a great one is reliability, and Globe trailers deliver it.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-features",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Built for Performance: Globe Trailer Features That Boost ROI",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "features"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-features-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you invest in a Globe trailer from Sun State Trailers, you're not just buying equipment; you're investing in long-term performance.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-features-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "num3",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "points": [],
                        "num": "1",
                        "title": "Rugged, High-Strength Construction",
                        "intro": "Globe trailers are made with engineered I-beam main frames and T-1 steel, delivering exceptional load capacity and torsional strength. This design resists fatigue and cracking far longer than standard builds."
                      },
                      {
                        "points": [],
                        "num": "2",
                        "title": "Custom Options for Every Industry",
                        "intro": "From lowboys to dumpends, Globe's product line offers customizable configurations. Optional features like hydraulic ramps, deck extensions, and air-ride suspension ensure your trailer works as hard as you do."
                      },
                      {
                        "points": [],
                        "num": "3",
                        "title": "Florida-Ready Durability",
                        "intro": "Sun exposure, humidity, and coastal corrosion can wear down lesser trailers fast. Globe combats that with zinc-rich primers, powder-coat finishes, and sealed wiring harnesses."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-features-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Find the right fit for your fleet. Browse our latest Globe trailers for sale in Florida, from lowboys to dumptrucks, all backed by local service and support.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-features-4",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-trailers",
                        "label": "Explore Our Trailer Inventory",
                        "style": "primary"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-efficiency",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Designed for Efficiency and Operator Confidence",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "efficiency"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-efficiency-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A dependable trailer isn't just about the steel; it's about how it feels to haul. Every Globe trailer is engineered with driver comfort and operational efficiency in mind.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-efficiency-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "type3",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Simplified Loading",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Hydraulic systems make connecting and disconnecting easier, cutting setup time."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Improved Safety",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "LED lighting, anti-slip decking, and durable tie-downs keep operators and cargo secure."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Ease of Service",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Modular wiring and accessible grease points make maintenance faster and more affordable."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-efficiency-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When paired with Sun State's local parts and service support, Globe trailers become more than equipment; they become an extension of your business operations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-sunstate",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Buy from Sun State Trailers",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-sunstate"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State Trailers, we know Florida's roads because we drive them too. As a family-owned dealership, we take pride in delivering a hands-on experience that national chains can't match.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our goal isn't just to make a sale; it's to build lasting partnerships. From your first trailer purchase to your next fleet expansion, we'll be there with transparent communication, responsive service, and dependable equipment.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>When you buy a Globe trailer through Sun State, you get:</strong>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-why-sunstate-4",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Certified product specialists who understand your business needs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Flexible financing options for fleets of any size"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Access to detailed trailer specifications for easier decision-making"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Dedicated service and parts teams to keep your trailers road-ready"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Every sale is backed by the same promise that's defined our reputation for decades: honest guidance, dependable support, and quality you can trust.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-1",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/globe-trailers-for-sale-in-florida/1.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 827,
                      "alt": "Sun State International dealership building with a red semi-truck parked in the lot"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-roi",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How Globe Trailers Support Long-Term ROI",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "roi"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-roi-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Think of a trailer purchase as a five-to-ten-year investment. A Globe trailer's heavy-duty frame, easy-service design, and corrosion-resistant build reduce the total cost of ownership year after year.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-roi-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "type3",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Lower Maintenance Costs",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Routine upkeep instead of major repairs."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Longer Service Life",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Durable materials extend usable lifespan by years."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Higher Resale Value",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Respected name and performance reputation boost trade-in worth."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-roi-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Over time, fleets that prioritize build quality and consistent maintenance see thousands in savings compared to those using lower-grade equipment. The result is a more efficient operation that keeps profits moving.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-roi-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you're a single owner-operator or managing a multi-unit fleet, <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a> makes it simple to grow your business with dependable equipment. When you're ready to invest in a trailer that works as hard as you do, our Tampa and Davenport teams are here to help. We'll walk you through every option, from deck size to weight ratings, so you can make a confident choice backed by real local support.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
